              <article class="panel provider-summary"><p class="eyebrow">CARE TEAM</p><div class="provider-identity"><img :src="provider.profile_photo_url" :alt="`${provider.name}, fictional provider`" width="52" height="60"><div><h3>{{ provider.name }}</h3><p>{{ provider.credential }} · Assigned provider</p></div></div><p class="small-copy">{{ provider.location }}</p><RouterLink :to="`/${slug}/providers?providerId=${provider.id}`" data-analytics-id="provider-profile-open">View provider profile →</RouterLink><div v-if="supervisor" class="mini-supervisor"><img :src="supervisor.profile_photo_url" :alt="`${supervisor.name}, fictional supervisor`" width="34" height="38"><div><strong>{{ supervisor.name }}, {{ supervisor.credential }}</strong><span>Clinical supervisor</span></div></div></article>
              <article class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT & ACCESS</p><h2>Connected, with clear permissions</h2><dl class="stacked-facts"><div><dt>Preferred contact</dt><dd>{{ client.preferred_contact }}</dd></div><div><dt>Portal</dt><dd>{{ client.portal }}</dd></div><div><dt>Care consent</dt><dd>{{ client.consent }}</dd></div></dl><button type="button" class="text-button" data-analytics-id="chart-tab" @click="tab = 'people'">People & consent →</button></article>
              <article class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">BILLING SNAPSHOT</p><dl class="stacked-facts"><div><dt>Payment arrangement</dt><dd>{{ client.payer }}</dd></div><div><dt>Illustrative client balance</dt><dd class="balance">{{ client.balance }}</dd></div></dl><p class="small-copy">Synthetic amounts · No payments connected</p></article>
            </aside>
          </div>
        </template>
        <template v-else-if="tab === 'plan'">
          <article class="panel detailed-plan"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ACTIVE TREATMENT PLAN</p><h2>{{ client.focus }}</h2></div><span class="badge green">{{ client.plan_status }}</span></div><p class="plan-goal">{{ client.goal }}</p><div class="plan-meta"><span><strong>Provider</strong>{{ client.provider_name }}, {{ client.provider_credential }}</span><span><strong>Prescribed frequency</strong>{{ client.frequency }}</span><span><strong>Review due</strong>{{ date(client.plan_review_date) }}</span></div><section class="objective-card"><p class="eyebrow">OBJECTIVE 01</p><h3>{{ client.objective }}</h3><p>Reviewed collaboratively in session and connected to progress notes.</p><template v-if="client.target"><div class="score-grid"><div><span>Baseline</span><strong>{{ client.baseline }}<small>/10</small></strong></div><div class="current-score"><span>Current</span><strong>{{ client.rating }}<small>/10</small></strong></div><div><span>Target</span><strong>{{ client.target }}<small>/10</small></strong></div></div><h4>Rating over time</h4><div class="rating-history" role="img" :aria-label="`Fictional ratings increased from ${client.baseline} to ${client.rating} over three reviews`"><div v-for="(rating, index) in [client.baseline, Math.round((client.baseline + client.rating) / 2), client.rating]" :key="index"><strong>{{ rating }}/10</strong><span :style="{height: `${rating * 9 + 12}px`}"></span><small>{{ date(demoDay(-28 + index * 14)) }}</small></div></div><p class="small-copy">Higher ratings indicate more consistent use of the skill. Ratings are recorded by the clinician; this example does not show an automated clinical judgment.</p></template><p v-else class="empty-inline">The initial assessment will guide the client’s goals and starting ratings.</p></section><RouterLink class="primary-button" :to="noteLink()" data-analytics-id="chart-note-open">See the plan alongside a note →</RouterLink></article>
        </template>
        <template v-else-if="tab === 'notes'">
          <article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">NOTES & DOCUMENTS</p><h2>Documentation connected to care</h2></div><RouterLink class="primary-button" :to="noteLink()" data-analytics-id="chart-note-open">Open Note Workspace →</RouterLink></div><p class="small-copy">Open a fictional draft, prior note or co-sign example. Signing and completion are simulated in this demo.</p><div class="document-list"><RouterLink v-for="(note, index) in chartNotes" :key="note.title" :to="noteLink(note.id)" class="document-row" data-analytics-id="chart-note-open"><span class="document-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span><span class="document-description"><strong>{{ note.title }}</strong><span>{{ note.author }} · {{ date(demoDay(-index * 7 - 1)) }} · {{ client.service }}</span></span><span class="badge" :class="note.status === 'Signed example' ? 'green' : 'gold'">{{ note.status }}</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></RouterLink></div></article>
          <article class="ai-callout"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><div><h3>AI assistance is optional. Your clinical judgment stays central.</h3><p>In the app, you can write your own note or use AI assistance. When enabled and with the required client consent, session transcription can help create a draft for the clinician to review and edit before signing. This demo does not record, transcribe or generate a note.</p></div></article>
        </template>
        <template v-else-if="tab === 'people'">
          <div class="chart-columns"><article class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">PEOPLE & CONTACTS</p><h2>{{ client.guardian_names.length ? 'Each person has their own account' : 'Client contact information' }}</h2><div class="person-row"><span class="small-avatar" aria-hidden="true">{{ client.initials.replaceAll('.', '') }}</span><div><h3>{{ client.full_name }}</h3><p>{{ client.age < 18 ? 'Minor client' : 'Client · Own portal access' }}</p><p>{{ client.email }}</p><p>{{ client.phone }}</p></div><span class="badge green">Active</span></div><div v-for="(guardian, index) in client.guardian_names" :key="guardian" class="person-row"><span class="small-avatar sage" aria-hidden="true">{{ guardian.split(' ').map(part => part[0]).join('') }}</span><div><h3>{{ guardian }}</h3><p>Guardian · Separate account</p><p>{{ index === 0 ? 'Appointments & forms · Reminder contact' : 'Appointments & forms · Own contact preferences' }}</p></div><span class="badge">Linked</span></div><p class="small-copy">All names and contact details are fictional. Access and reminder choices are individual to each linked person.</p></article><article class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">CONSENT & PREFERENCES</p><h2>Permission is part of the workflow</h2><dl class="stacked-facts"><div><dt>Care consent</dt><dd>{{ client.consent }}</dd></div><div><dt>Appointment reminders</dt><dd>{{ client.status === 'INTAKE' ? 'Preferences to review' : 'SMS reminders enabled in this example' }}</dd></div><div><dt>Session recording & transcription</dt><dd>{{ client.recording_consent ? 'Example consent on file · Confirm current consent before use' : 'Not enabled · Consent required before use' }}</dd></div><div><dt>Optional AI note assistance</dt><dd>Clinician can choose manual documentation or an assisted draft.</dd></div></dl><p class="consent-note">No microphone, recording, texts or emails are connected to this demo.</p></article></div>
